{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.NumberTheory.Bernoulli","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.coeff_one_hbarLogPochCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.coeff_one_hbarLogPochCoeff","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ToddDilogExpansion.lean#L119-L126","doc":"The first correction is `−½ log(1 − x)`: the `ħ¹` coefficient of each `xᵐ` is\n`1/(2m)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.coeff_zero_hbarLogPochCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.coeff_zero_hbarLogPochCoeff","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ToddDilogExpansion.lean#L114-L117","doc":"The leading term is `Li₂`: the `ħ⁰` coefficient of each `xᵐ` is `1/m²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.hbarLogPoch_eq_todd_expansion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.hbarLogPoch_eq_todd_expansion","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ToddDilogExpansion.lean#L106-L112","doc":"**The Todd expansion**, coefficient by coefficient:\n`ħ · log (x; e^{−ħ})_∞ = Σ_n (B'_n/n!) ħⁿ Li_{2−n}(x)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.hbarLogPoch","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.hbarLogPoch","kind":"def","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ToddDilogExpansion.lean#L103-L104","doc":"`ħ · log (x; e^{−ħ})_∞` as a power series in `x` with coefficients in `A⟦ħ⟧`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.coeff_hbarLogPochCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.coeff_hbarLogPochCoeff","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ToddDilogExpansion.lean#L93-L101","doc":"**The `ħⁿ xᵐ` coefficient** is `(B'_n/n!) · m^{n−2}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.polylogNeg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.polylogNeg","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ToddDilogExpansion.lean#L89-L91","doc":"The formal polylogarithm `Li_{2−n}(x) = Σ_{m ≥ 1} m^{n−2} xᵐ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.hbarLogPochCoeff_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.hbarLogPochCoeff_unique","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ToddDilogExpansion.lean#L83-L87","doc":"**Uniqueness:** the equation `F · (1 − e^{−mħ}) = ħ/m` determines `F`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.oneSubQPow_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.oneSubQPow_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ToddDilogExpansion.lean#L76-L81","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.hbarLogPochCoeff_spec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.hbarLogPochCoeff_spec","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ToddDilogExpansion.lean#L66-L74","doc":"`hbarLogPochCoeff m` satisfies `F · (1 − e^{−mħ}) = ħ/m`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.rescale_X'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.rescale_X'","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ToddDilogExpansion.lean#L63-L64","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.hbarLogPochCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.hbarLogPochCoeff","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ToddDilogExpansion.lean#L57-L60","doc":"**The `xᵐ` coefficient of `ħ · log (x; e^{−ħ})_∞`**, i.e. `ħ/(m(1 − e^{−mħ}))`, as\n`m⁻² · Todd(mħ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.oneSubQPow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.oneSubQPow","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ToddDilogExpansion.lean#L54-L55","doc":"`1 − e^{−mħ}`, i.e. `1 − qᵐ` at `q = e^{−ħ}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.todd_mul_one_sub_exp_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.todd_mul_one_sub_exp_neg","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ToddDilogExpansion.lean#L44-L52","doc":"**Defining equation of the Todd series:** `Todd(t) · (1 − e^{−t}) = t`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.todd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.ToddDilogExpansion.todd","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/ToddDilogExpansion.lean#L41-L42","doc":"The Todd series `t/(1 − e^{−t}) = Σ_n B'_n tⁿ/n!`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}